Generic bounded parent cohorts with explicit resource subjects
=============================================================

This package is new metadata Source. No entry, control, scientific function or
canonical writer has been executed by its author. Root grants in the templates
are false. Cohort414..425 is already registered at prefix426 and must never be
replayed by this package. The ordinary mathematical result and all old
computations retain their authorship; this work supplies reusable interfaces,
byte-preserving administration and finite resource accounting.

One route for future cohorts
----------------------------

The eight entries are init.py, phase.py, close.py, audit_batch.py,
audit_cohort.py, register.py, check_registration.py and controls.py. Each takes
--actor /root --packet PATH BYTES SHA --request PATH BYTES SHA
--Root-gate PATH BYTES SHA --guard GUARD --out OUT. The Source entry and every
loaded shared module are whole-byte pinned before compile. No project module
is loaded through an ordinary import or cached bytecode.

init fixes1..4 batches of1..3 parents at the current registered prefix, at
least426. Both the old preparation directory and the new cohort directory
must be absent at that prefix. The old940-parent roster, complete actual
roster acceptance and mathematical assumptions are retained. Source indices
are explicit consecutive integers; no old parent is counted again. Exact
frozen copies of intake, controller and runtime are saved with the cohort.
Later proof review uses these immutable aliases instead of assuming that
mutable canonical paths still contain an old edition.

Every role is assigned either legacy or bounded before its first invocation.
Legacy means exact c879 supplier or ebef strict Source, the original64KiB
scientific namespace, the original10GiB/8GiB disk profile and original guards.
Bounded means the separately reviewed Core V2 scientific manifests, the new
2GiB/1GiB profile and its explicit256MiB writer budget. Source/guard/marker
identities are never normalized from one branch to another. Mathematical
worker bodies are literal; the old24/41 control facts are borrowed only for
the unchanged numerical function subjects. New admission, recording and
metadata logic requires its own controls. No old successful control or
scientific calculation is rerun for bookkeeping.

phase prepares suppliers, assembles their complete covers for one strict
check, then joins the strict result to the individual supplier covers. Old
Root template bodies are used as literal data; Original parent/cover values
are transplanted as opaque JSON byte spans. Fresh imports and gates are
issued only under a new positive Root phase grant which owns their exact
original meanings. This is not a retagging of an old Root operation.
Internal prepared-role kinds remain supply/check. The literal scientific
request and bounded-budget role strings are respectively
f009_complete_parent_stabilizer_supplier and f009_incremental_parent_cover.
One production mapping validates both profile branches; a short kind is
never passed as the scientific ROLE to the Core authority validator.
Every new scientific budget is owned before request/gate construction. Its
command projection contains literal paths plus typed descriptor slots; after
construction the exact projected command is checked. Root subsequently
issues a separate launch pinning the full command and all final descriptors.
The launch is not back-referenced by the request, gate or budget, so no
cryptographic hash cycle is introduced.

Attempt records and genuine execution
-------------------------------------

