issuing the outer launch; no successful result is claimed for a refused
inadmissible budget. These are logical project body-byte bounds, not a
measurement of Python/platform library loading or physical page/disk IO.
Core's169MiB conservative component ledger fits its256MiB invocation reserve.
The1GiB floor is sampled and cleaned up by the inherited supervisor; it is
not a kernel disk quota or a bound on unrelated external writers.

